REMINDER of our next US/Europe Open Printing phone call.
Please join us - all are welcome.

    - Tuesday 8 September 2009, Daytime
      - US
        8am in San Francisco - US PDT (Pacific Daylight Time)
        9am in Colorado - US MDT (Mountain Daylight Time)
        10am in Chicago - US CDT (Central Daylight Time)
        11am in New York - US EDT (Eastern Daylight Time)
      - Europe
        5pm in Berlin - CEST (Central European Summer Time)

    * Main Number (Till Kamppeter, LF, leader)
      International: +1-218-936-7999
      Access Code:   491659#

Agenda topics will include:

(1) GSoC 2009 Wrap-up (Till, Lars, OpenICC)

(2) Common Print Dialog (Till, Lars)

(3) 3-day tutorial for printer manufacturers (proposal by Till)
     - driiver design
     - driver packaging for autodownload
     - Common Printing Dialog

(4) PWG Project Report (Ira)
     - Power Management Model (XML and SNMP)
     - IPP Production Print Set2 (job save, proof print, etc.)
     - Imaging Device Security (MS-NAP, IETF NEA/TCG TNC)

(5) Any other topics

